# Zig build output
#
# Added by this fork; every rule above is upstream's and is kept verbatim. The
# four entries are needed because upstream 2.12.0's `.gitignore` has no Zig
# entries at all -- it predates this package's `build.zig` being extended --
# while it does ignore C build products by name.
#
# Each is root-anchored or explicitly prefixed, so no upstream rule is widened
# and none is removed. In particular the `*.a`, `*.so*`, `*.dll`, `*.dylib`,
# `*.exe`, `*.o`, `*.out` and `*.new` patterns above are unanchored, so they
# match at any depth: they must keep matching here, because the fork's own
# files may not be excluded by an upstream convention, and no fork file ends
# in one of those extensions. The fork's record files are written directly
# under their final names; `UPSTREAM.sha256.new` is never created.
#
# `/data/*.txt` and `/tmp/` and `/build/` above are root-anchored, so none of
# them reaches `testdata/`: the committed Unicode corpora are not ignored, and
# no pattern in the file above matches any path under `testdata/`.
/.zig-cache/
/zig-out/
/consumer/.zig-cache/
/consumer/zig-out/

# Nix and devenv working-tree artefacts
#
# Added by this fork for the standalone Nix and devenv delivery, on the same
# terms as the Zig block above: nothing upstream is removed, and every entry is
# root-anchored so no upstream unanchored pattern is widened.
#
# `nix build` writes `result`, and `result-1`, `result-2`, ... on a rebuild,
# into the directory that asked for it. `devenv` writes its resolved inputs and
# its state beside the project as `.devenv/`, `.devenv.flake.nix` and
# `.devenv.flakes/`, and `devenv.local.nix` is the per-developer override it
# reads. None of them is named in `build.zig.zon`'s `.paths`, so an ignored path
# cannot become package content either.
#
# `flake.lock` and `devenv.lock` are deliberately *not* here: they are real
# inputs, they belong to the driver, and ignoring them would be the wrong way to
# keep a lock out of a commit. Upstream's unanchored `*.out` and `/build/` above
# match none of these names.
/result
/result-*
/.devenv/
/.devenv.flake.nix
/.devenv.flakes/
/devenv.local.nix
